sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as "Background Thread (main)"
    participant Core as "ARM Cortex-M4F Core (ARMv7E-M)"
    participant Stack as "Active Stack (MSP / PSP)"
    participant NVIC as "NVIC (102 External IRQs on G474RE)"
    participant ISR as "Interrupt Handler (ISR)"

    App->>Core: Executing normal background code in Thread Mode
    Note over NVIC: Peripheral asserts IRQ request line
    NVIC->>Core: Signals pending interrupt with 4-bit priority evaluation
    Note over Core: Core finishes current instruction (12-cycle entry latency)

    Core->>Stack: Hardware Stacking (8 words: R0-R3, R12, LR, PC, xPSR + Lazy FPU reserve if FPCA=1)
    Core->>Core: Loads EXC_RETURN into LR (e.g. 0xFFFFFFF9 MSP / 0xFFFFFFFD PSP)
    Core->>Core: Fetches ISR vector from VTOR (512-byte aligned) and enters Handler Mode (MSP)

    Core->>ISR: Executes Interrupt Handler
    Note over ISR: Clears peripheral flag (rc_w1 direct = or rc_w0 = ~flag) and executes __DSB()
    ISR->>Core: Executes BX LR with EXC_RETURN (6-cycle tail-chain if another IRQ pending)

    Core->>Stack: Hardware Unstacking restores [R0-R3, R12, LR, PC, xPSR]
    Core->>Core: Returns to Thread Mode
    Core->>App: Resumes background thread execution seamlessly
